# LIQUID-05 — Hoist invariant work out of loops

## Rationale

Repeating constant computation per iteration multiplies render cost.

## How to check

Read the loop body; identify `assign`/filter chains that are constant across
iterations.

## How to fix

Propose moving invariant `assign`s above the loop.

## Examples

### Bad

```liquid
{% for product in collection.products limit: section.settings.product_limit %}
  {% assign card_class = section.settings.card_style | prepend: 'product-card--' %}
  <article class="product-card {{ card_class }}">
    {{ product.title }}
  </article>
{% endfor %}
```

### Good

```liquid
{% assign card_class = section.settings.card_style | prepend: 'product-card--' %}
{% for product in collection.products limit: section.settings.product_limit %}
  <article class="product-card {{ card_class }}">
    {{ product.title }}
  </article>
{% endfor %}
```
